1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,930
Excuse me, how can I get to the science building?

2
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:06,010
Go straight along this path and turn left at the library.

3
00:00:06,010 --> 00:00:07,570
Is it far from here?

4
00:00:07,570 --> 00:00:09,500
About ten minutes on foot.

5
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,090
You cannot miss it.

